  "description": "Linux TPM 2.0 hardware-backed master-key protector for TopSecret.ProtectedString. References the main package and auto-registers via ModuleInitializer when loaded on Linux. Uses Microsoft.TSS to talk TPM 2.0 commands directly to /dev/tpmrm0 (RSA-2048 OAEP-SHA256). On non-Linux hosts the package is a no-op.",
